WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:13.021
Everyone swam to the cement block.

2
00:00:13.022 --> 00:00:17.207
The fringeheads were still fighting.

3
00:00:17.208 --> 00:00:20.907
"It's mine!" one said.

4
00:00:20.908 --> 00:00:29.806
"It's mine !" the other one

5
00:00:29.807 --> 00:00:34.386
yelled. Clive started

6
00:00:34.387 --> 00:00:42.379
digging. Sand flew

7
00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:48.385
everywhere. Soon there was a deep

8
00:00:48.386 --> 00:00:52.471
burrow. "Hey, fringeheads!" Cora

9
00:00:52.472 --> 00:00:55.401
yelled. The fish kept fighting.

10
00:00:55.402 --> 00:00:58.770
"Ugh!" Cora said.

11
00:00:58.771 --> 00:01:01.586
"How will we get them to listen?"

12
00:01:01.587 --> 00:01:07.085
"I know!" Clive said.

13
00:01:07.086 --> 00:01:10.118
"Let's show them how fun the burrow is."

14
00:01:10.119 --> 00:01:18.024
"Great idea!" Mo said.

15
00:01:18.025 --> 00:01:22.351
The three friends swam near the burrow.

16
00:01:22.352 --> 00:01:27.038
"Wow, this looks cozy!" Mo said loudly.

17
00:01:27.039 --> 00:01:31.671
Cora picked up some shells.

18
00:01:31.672 --> 00:01:36.182
"What beautiful decorations!"

19
00:01:36.183 --> 00:01:44.643
"This is such a nice house!" Clive said.

20
00:01:44.644 --> 00:01:48.035
Finally one fringehead swam over and looked.

21
00:01:48.036 --> 00:01:49.763
Then—

22
00:01:49.764 --> 00:01:58.160
bam! He pushed his way

23
00:01:58.161 --> 00:02:06.672
inside. Cora, Mo, and Clive swam

24
00:02:06.673 --> 00:02:13.042
away. "Ahh!" Cora said. "The reef is peaceful again."

25
00:02:13.043 --> 00:02:15.717
"Thank you, Clive," Mo said.

26
00:02:15.718 --> 00:02:19.018
"No problem," Clive said.

27
00:02:19.019 --> 00:02:22.710
"Do you want to see my rock garden?" Cora asked.

28
00:02:22.711 --> 00:02:25.205
"Sure," Clive said.

29
00:02:25.206 --> 00:02:30.268
Cora grinned. "Maybe we can make a trade . . .

30
00:02:30.269 --> 00:02:39.931
A pretty rock for a pretty pearl?"

